layout_mode = 2
text = "Remember to completely and accurately fill in each bubble for every question, ensuring the entire bubble is covered and there are no stray marks. If you make a mistake, erase it completely before selecting another answer. Always fill in only one bubble per question, as multiple marks will be counted as incorrect. 

Neither talking nor phone use is allowed during the exam.

You may temporarily turn in your exam if you need to use the rest-room."
